{"parse": {"title": "PD-14", "pageid": 144781, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/PD-13\" title=\"PD-13\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">PD-14</span><a href=\"/wiki/PD-15\" title=\"PD-15\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">PD</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">14</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E5.86.8D.E8.A7.81.EF.BC.8C.E5.88.87.E6.B4.9B.E6.A2.85\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"再见，切洛梅\">再见，切洛梅</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 再见，切洛梅</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Goodbye, Chelomey</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>进<span class=\"color-value\"></span>步<span class=\"color-value\"></span>属<span class=\"color-value\"></span>于<span class=\"color-value\"></span>所<span class=\"color-value\"></span>有<span class=\"color-value\"></span>人<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 38510115</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-s02_bg_19.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"s02_bg_19\"><img alt=\"s02_bg_19\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/Cg-s02_bg_19.png/600px-Cg-s02_bg_19.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/Cg-s02_bg_19.png/900px-Cg-s02_bg_19.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/Cg-s02_bg_19.png/1200px-Cg-s02_bg_19.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“大集体2.0”开启前夕，切洛梅被喜庆装点，人们纷纷走上街头，迎接这不同寻常的一天。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>年轻的访客们踏出医院的门口，从安宁走向喧闹。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>所有幸存的科学家都康复了？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>是的。受害者们得到了及时救治，国家层面在进行交涉，聚合物展览馆也被封锁起来，事情确实告一段落了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>不过双生舞伶怎么样了？这段时间在医院没有听闻太多和她们有关的消息。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"652902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"652902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>谢切诺夫博士为她们做了一副新的身体，她们现在恢复如初了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>马克西姆呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"652902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"652902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>……关于他，似乎还有一些事后处置，但具体的得问问谢切诺夫博士了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>也好，我也有些疑问想要确认一下。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>年轻的访客们继续向前走去。不远处，双生舞伶优雅地站在一辆迎宾车前，谢切诺夫从车窗中看向这边。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"652202.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-652202.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-652202.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"652202.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-652202.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-652202.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-652202.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-652202.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">谢切诺夫：</div><div>孩子们！能见到你们实在开心，可我们的时间不多，下一批记者很快就到。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"652902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"652902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>谢切诺夫博士。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"652202.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-652202.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-652202.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"652202.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-652202.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-652202.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-652202.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-652202.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">谢切诺夫：</div><div>很抱歉将你们牵扯进来，握个手好吗？多亏了你们，我们才能在损失最小的情况下解决这次危机，请让我表示一下感谢。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>几人挨个儿与谢切诺夫握了手，他的手劲适中，足够坚定又不会太激进，掌心也十分温暖柔软。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"652202.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-652202.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-652202.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"652202.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-652202.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-652202.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-652202.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-652202.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">谢切诺夫：</div><div>三位都是非常优秀的年轻人，我能给你们的不多。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"652202.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-652202.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-652202.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"652202.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-652202.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-652202.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-652202.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-652202.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">谢切诺夫：</div><div>如果你们有想追随的导师，我可以为你们写一封推荐信，并承担你们求学期间全部的费用，只要你们想。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"652202.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-652202.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-652202.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"652202.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-652202.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-652202.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-652202.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-652202.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">谢切诺夫：</div><div>我也十分欢迎你们加入到“大集体2.0”的项目中，与我们一起建设光明的未来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"652902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"652902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>很感谢您的认可，但我想，我们没办法留在这里太久。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>访客们互相递了个眼神。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>以及……谢切诺夫博士，“大集体2.0”似乎并没有您说得那样安全。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>面前的项目主导者思考了片刻。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"652202.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-652202.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-652202.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"652202.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-652202.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-652202.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-652202.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-652202.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">谢切诺夫：</div><div>这件事的确给我敲响了警钟，我很遗憾这些疏漏没能在事件发生前就为人察觉——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"652202.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-652202.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-652202.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"652202.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-652202.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-652202.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-652202.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-652202.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">谢切诺夫：</div><div>不过现在科学家们正在着手修补马克西姆利用过的所有系统漏洞，在这之后，我们也会对类似的事更加警惕。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"652202.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-652202.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-652202.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"652202.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-652202.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-652202.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-652202.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-652202.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">谢切诺夫：</div><div>“大集体2.0”也会因此趋于完美，它仍然是这个国家以及所有公民最不可或缺的助力。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>迟疑只如蜻蜓点水般停留，谢切诺夫的笃定与执着并未因此动摇。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>毫无缺漏且完美的系统——嗯……如果实现了，的确是划时代的成就吧～</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>某种程度上不亚于以人力改变太阳的运行轨迹——X将最后的判断隐于心中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"652202.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-652202.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-652202.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"652202.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-652202.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-652202.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-652202.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-652202.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">谢切诺夫：</div><div>这就是我对科学的最终设想，所有科学家也都在为此努力。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这一疑问被画上了彻底的句点。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"652902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"652902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>谢切诺夫博士，我们还有点事情想知道。关于马克西姆……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>谢切诺夫博士叹了口气。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"652202.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-652202.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-652202.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"652202.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-652202.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-652202.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-652202.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-652202.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">谢切诺夫：</div><div>马克西姆已经被妥善安置，这起事故最后的处理结果，我们会仔细商讨，争取一个让大家都能满意的结果。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"652202.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-652202.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-652202.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"652202.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-652202.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-652202.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-652202.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-652202.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">谢切诺夫：</div><div>这件事……仅凭他一人是很难做到的，至于在幕后操控他而实现自我私欲的人，我心中也有数。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"652202.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-652202.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-652202.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"652202.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-652202.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-652202.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-652202.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-652202.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">谢切诺夫：</div><div>莫洛托夫与我的意见向来不合——噢，还是别让这件事烦扰到你们。年轻人，好好享受今天的庆典吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"652202.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-652202.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-652202.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"652202.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-652202.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-652202.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-652202.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-652202.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">谢切诺夫：</div><div>不过之后我无法陪同你们了，今天我的日程实在被塞满了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"652902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"652902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>那我们就不打扰您了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"652202.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-652202.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-652202.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"652202.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-652202.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-652202.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-652202.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-652202.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">谢切诺夫：</div><div>再见，年轻人，希望以后能再次看到你们的学术成果！</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-s02_bg_19.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"s02_bg_19\"><img alt=\"s02_bg_19\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/Cg-s02_bg_19.png/600px-Cg-s02_bg_19.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/Cg-s02_bg_19.png/900px-Cg-s02_bg_19.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/Cg-s02_bg_19.png/1200px-Cg-s02_bg_19.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>迎宾车驶离后，附近的人群逐渐变多了，几人只能从小道离开。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"650712.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-650712.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-650712.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"650712.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-650712.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-650712.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-650712.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-650712.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">P-3：</div><div>嘿！这里！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"652902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"652902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>嗯？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>顺着声音寻过去，P-3正站在河边，从一台“鸨式”机器人的腹腔中接过一杯汽水。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">P-3：</div><div>这么热闹的庆典，不喝点儿什么来庆祝一下吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“鸨式”机器人在几人面前悬停。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"652902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"652902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>三杯汽水，谢谢。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">P-3：</div><div>再过一会儿，谢切诺夫博士就会开始演讲，然后正式开启“大集体2.0”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一队年轻人踏着整齐的步伐从旁走过，他们昂首挺胸，挥洒着青春与活力。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"650801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-650801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-650801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"650801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-650801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-650801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-650801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-650801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>这是什么队列？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"650711.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/49/HeadIconSmall-650711.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-650711.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"650711.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/49/HeadIconSmall-650711.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-650711.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/49/HeadIconSmall-650711.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-650711.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">P-3：</div><div>嗯——横幅上写的是“烈士遗孤方队”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"650711.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/49/HeadIconSmall-650711.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-650711.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"650711.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/49/HeadIconSmall-650711.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-650711.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/49/HeadIconSmall-650711.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-650711.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">P-3：</div><div>“为了纪念那些托举起整个国家的人。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>人的生命终究有限，但“传承”的意义也因此显现。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"652902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"652902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>那些前人无法见证或实现的理想，最终会在后人的身上成为具实可触的现实。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">P-3：</div><div>是啊，不过也不必太过严肃——今天是个好日子，来点音乐吧！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>好啊。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>X举起“八音盒”枪，向天开了一枪，“嗙！”枪口却没有射出子弹，取而代之的是飞舞的彩带，音乐也随之喷涌而出。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">P-3：</div><div>真不错！你什么时候改成彩炮的？难不成是在医院的时候？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">P-3：</div><div>我算是了解枪械，可我怎么都弄不懂你这是怎么改装的，教教我呗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>这个嘛……就是一些“专利技术”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>P-3热情地把X揽到了胳膊下，半强迫地开始询问他“八音盒”枪的制作方法。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"652902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"652902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>X什么时候跟P-3如此熟络了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>谁知道呢。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>不过X放的那首歌，左伶曾因此产生了名为“感动”的情绪——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>我一直在想，这首歌对她的意义是什么呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"650712.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-650712.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-650712.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"650712.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-650712.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-650712.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-650712.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-650712.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">P-3：</div><div>噢，不瞒你说，我也认为这首曲子很不错，尤其适合用来求婚。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一旁的P-3终于结束了机械改造的话题。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">P-3：</div><div>这首曲子叫什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">查尔斯：</div><div>《花之圆舞曲》，少校。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">P-3：</div><div>《花之圆舞曲》，哦！之前在哪里听过……是在哪里呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">查尔斯：</div><div>这首曲子很有名，你在哪里听过都不意外。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">P-3：</div><div>不，绝对不是这么简单……对我来说，它肯定有什么特殊的意义！就在我失忆之前！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">P-3：</div><div>说不定我真的用它求过婚！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">查尔斯：</div><div>那一定是对方选的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>趁着P-3与查尔斯斗嘴，X松了口气，悄悄从P-3的钳制下溜走，回到同伴身边。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>事情圆满解决，我们的实验看来也该就此结束了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>伴随着一声礼炮，一大片彩色的气球升了起来，在人们欣喜的惊呼声中齐齐飞上天空。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"621601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-621601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-621601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"621601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-621601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-621601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-621601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-621601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小女孩：</div><div>妈妈……！里面也有我的气球！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"521220.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/49/HeadIconSmall-521220.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-521220.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"521220.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/49/HeadIconSmall-521220.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-521220.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/49/HeadIconSmall-521220.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-521220.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">中年女性：</div><div>哪一个？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"621601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-621601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-621601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"621601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-621601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-621601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-621601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-621601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小女孩：</div><div>嗯……看不见了！但就在里面！它们会飞去哪里？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"521220.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/49/HeadIconSmall-521220.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-521220.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"521220.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/49/HeadIconSmall-521220.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-521220.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/49/HeadIconSmall-521220.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-521220.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">中年女性：</div><div>未来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"652902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"652902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>X，你想好要给露西女士带什么礼物了吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"650813.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b7/HeadIconSmall-650813.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-650813.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"650813.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b7/HeadIconSmall-650813.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-650813.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b7/HeadIconSmall-650813.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-650813.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>嗯……这倒是……</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "PD-14"}}